{
  "title": "Asterisk Setup: Connect Your Own Phone System | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "Asterisk is a phone system your company runs itself. This video walks through the Asterisk tab of the telephony settings in CrestApps for Orchard Core: the connection to Asterisk's ARI web interface, voicemail, audio in the browser, and what Asterisk can and cannot do.\n\nIn this video:\n• What Asterisk needs\n• Enabling the provider, the ARI address, the Stasis application name, the endpoint template\n• Voicemail routing\n• Browser audio: SIP WebSocket, ICE and TURN, codecs, PJSIP Realtime\n• What Asterisk can do",
